{"4507450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runner Overdrive", "steam_appid": 4507450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4884780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/632fba55ac91c26bcc4b8cbb046e1ce8.poster.avif?t=1783277842\" width=1170 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/632fba55ac91c26bcc4b8cbb046e1ce8.webm?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/632fba55ac91c26bcc4b8cbb046e1ce8.mp4?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MOVE FAST, SHOOT FASTER</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your revolver is your weapon and your wings. Blast through enemies, bounce off walls, and use your own recoil to sling yourself across the level before anyone knows what hit them. The package isn't just your cargo: it's a tool, a platform, and a projectile. Learn to use everything at your disposal, and the game opens up. Play it slow, and you won't last long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/65fa808bc7bd886c5cc350f1b37ca7b6.poster.avif?t=1783277842\" width=946 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/65fa808bc7bd886c5cc350f1b37ca7b6.webm?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/65fa808bc7bd886c5cc350f1b37ca7b6.mp4?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DELIVER THE PACKAGE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were hired on as a delivery runner. Delivering what? Who knows. Your only job is to ensure the package arrives safely and to blast through anything that might get in your way. You have 9 missions in your contract, get them done, get out, and don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/d161b70cbf4675e7e677a2ab5ad6ec97.poster.avif?t=1783277842\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/d161b70cbf4675e7e677a2ab5ad6ec97.webm?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/d161b70cbf4675e7e677a2ab5ad6ec97.mp4?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UPGRADE YOUR GEAR</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bolster your stats, create wild builds, and gain an overwhelming advantage against your enemies with upgrades, or use overdrives to turn the tide when things get dicey. Stock up between missions, choose your loadout carefully, and make sure you're ready for whatever's waiting at the drop point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/9c401cb8a3fe7cb0b12528cfb3218f10.poster.avif?t=1783277842\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/9c401cb8a3fe7cb0b12528cfb3218f10.webm?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/9c401cb8a3fe7cb0b12528cfb3218f10.mp4?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MEET THE LOCALS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is held together with duct tape and denial. The people in it aren't much different. Get to know your crew between missions, talk to the people you probably shouldn't, and figure out what actually happened to make everything this bad. The world didn't end by accident, and someone out there knows exactly why it happened and how to fix it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/632fba55ac91c26bcc4b8cbb046e1ce8.poster.avif?t=1783277842\" width=1170 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/632fba55ac91c26bcc4b8cbb046e1ce8.webm?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/632fba55ac91c26bcc4b8cbb046e1ce8.mp4?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>MOVE FAST, SHOOT FASTER</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your revolver is your weapon and your wings. Blast through enemies, bounce off walls, and use your own recoil to sling yourself across the level before anyone knows what hit them. The package isn't just your cargo: it's a tool, a platform, and a projectile. Learn to use everything at your disposal, and the game opens up. Play it slow, and you won't last long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item