\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/9c401cb8a3fe7cb0b12528cfb3218f10.poster.avif?t=1783277842\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/9c401cb8a3fe7cb0b12528cfb3218f10.webm?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/extras/9c401cb8a3fe7cb0b12528cfb3218f10.mp4?t=1783277842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MEET THE LOCALS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is held together with duct tape and denial. The people in it aren't much different. Get to know your crew between missions, talk to the people you probably shouldn't, and figure out what actually happened to make everything this bad. The world didn't end by accident, and someone out there knows exactly why it happened and how to fix it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Something tore your world apart. Now it's on you to keep it running, one delivery at a time. Blast your way through this action-packed precision platformer, make weird friends and even weirder enemies, and uncover the truth behind why everything went to ash.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/f682d34724ff88440ec58651003f854f65c22be7/header.jpg?t=1783277842", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/174f22ef288a547fde0daa030c7204640da63512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783277842", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4507450/174f22ef288a547fde0daa030c7204640da63512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=